<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 400 mln Danish crown step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 400 mln Danish crown step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Bruxelles Lambert and Banque Intenationale a Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON    *6.50 PCT  MATURITY    27.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102	 PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 7.09 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	*YEARS ONE TO FIVE, 8.25 PCT YEARS FIVE TO EIGHT AND</p>
<p>		 9.25 PCT YEARS EIGHT TO 10.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.75 PCT  SELL CONC   1.25 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED ISSUE</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
